      "a": "AmerisourceBergen Drug has received $4.7B in federal contract obligations in FY2026 to date. The company received 298,428 awards with an average award size of $15.8K. Obligations fell 36.6% year over year, and FY2026 totals are fiscal year to date and therefore partial."
